        "issue": "An independently written contents list can diverge from rendered heading IDs or include removed editorial headings.",
        "resolution": "Use the renderer’s actual heading metadata, select second-level sections, omit duplicate/empty entries and show contents only from four eligible sections."
      },
      {
        "issue": "Template updates could be mistaken for newly written or revised content.",
        "resolution": "Preserve every source date. Show the original publication date and only a recorded modification strictly later than publication; labels use the article language."
      },
      {
        "issue": "Wrapping metadata can leave an orphan separator on mobile.",
        "resolution": "Keep each labeled date together and omit the leading modification separator. Test320/1280px for every contents article and320px news in all eight languages."
      },
      {
        "issue": "A test mistook the CSS selector for an actual contents element.",
        "resolution": "Assert the details element rather than a class-name substring; digest pages remain without contents."
